WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.400
In the musical Fiddler on
the Roof, a poor milkman,

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.710
Tevye, talks to God.

3
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.440
Since we are your chosen people, he says,

4
00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:11.560
could you not choose someone
else, once in a while?

5
00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.060
Yet before the Torah is read in synagogue,

6
00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:16.560
Jews bless God for choosing them.

7
00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:20.840
And a sincere convert from any
background can join the chosen people.

8
00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:22.900
So chosen for what?

9
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.280
And what does it mean for everyone else?

10
00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:29.790
In this mission, you'll read what the
Torah and the prophets say about why Israel

11
00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:30.990
was chosen.

12
00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.670
Then you'll meet Jewish
thinkers on other faiths,

13
00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:36.680
from Jonathan Sacks to
Joseph Soloveitchik.

14
00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:40.110
Your mission: explain
what Jews are chosen for,

15
00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.190
and what that means for everyone else.
